            "review_title": "Review at Uraetei BBQ Japan - Nha Hang Pho Dinh",
            "review_text": "L jdevilliers\nYoungs Siding, Australia13 contributions\n0\nFavorite so far!\nMar 2020 • Couples\nWent walking around da nang looking for something to eat and found this place. Although the staff didn't speak a word of english we managed to order. Before we even had a look at a menu two bowls of salad and dipping sauce came to our table. We ordered some beef and pork ribs, a chef brought out some hot coals to the table and some raw meat followed. One of the waitresses showed us how to cook the meat as she could see we didn't have a clue. Oh my goodness, it was the best tasting thing I have had since being in Vietnam. Every meat we tried was delish. I wish we stayed in danang longer to try more meals here.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 10, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
